GET    /api/v1/tenants/{id}/hierarchy/tree           → Full org tree
POST   /api/v1/tenants/{id}/identities               → Create identity (→ UNASSIGNED)
GET    /api/v1/hierarchy/{nodeId}/descendants         → O(1) subtree
