PAW's `ElpBridge` is listening on ActiveMQ for `INTERACTION/NEW` events:

```java
@JmsListener(destination = "VirtualTopic.endeavour.events")
public void onInteraction(InteractionEvent event) {
    if (!"SALE".equals(event.getInteractionType())) return;

    // Map ELP member → PAW identity
    PawIdentity rep = identityService.findByElpMemberId("elp_8843");
    // rep = Dave (DAVE004)

    // Resolve hierarchy via closure table (O(1), ~1.2ms)
    HierarchyResolution resolution = hierarchyService.resolveRollUp("DAVE004");
    // resolution.primaryPath = [Dave → Bob → Alice]
    // resolution.strategy = STRICT_TREE_ENFORCED

    // Fire Terminal Event back to ELP
    TerminalEvent terminal = TerminalEvent.builder()
        .subject(rep)
        .resolvedHierarchy(resolution)
        .instruction(new AwardInstruction("TRIGGER_LEDGER_CREDIT", 500))
        .build();
    elpBridge.fireTerminalEvent(terminal);
}
```

