1. Build new hierarchy in `paw_closure_staging` (background, ~30 seconds)
2. Validate: no cycles, no orphans, all identities accounted for
3. Atomic swap: `RENAME TABLE paw_closure TO paw_closure_lkg, paw_closure_staging TO paw_closure`
4. Old table kept as `paw_closure_lkg` for 3-day rollback window
5. Zero downtime — reads continue on whichever table name is `paw_closure`

