### Is This PAW? **No.**

| Aspect | Avis Unlimited Rewards | PAW |
|---|---|---|
| **Purpose** | Client-specific loyalty program customization (car rentals + hotel stays → points) | Generic B2B hierarchy engine (org charts, manager chains, commission roll-ups) |
| **Architecture** | Plugin JARs dropped into ELP's existing services | Standalone sidecar service with its own Jetty instance |
| **Database** | Uses ELP's ODS + small client-specific schema | Own separate database (`paw_db`) with 6 tables |
| **REST API** | Extends ELP's API with `/client/...` prefix | Entirely new API on separate port (8920) |
| **Batch** | Heavy batch processing (30+ scheduled jobs) | Minimal batch (Table Swap only) |
| **Gateway** | Registers as Gateway Provider for booking data | Listens to events, doesn't register as Provider |
| **Reusable?** | No — specific to Avis/Budget/Hilton | Yes — any client with a sales hierarchy |
| **Hierarchy?** | None — flat member model only | Core feature — DAG with closure table |

